  "source_basis": "Upstream elkjs 0.12.1 release declares ELK 0.12.1; immutable ELK/elkjs commit source archives, all 12 npm files identical to the elkjs release commit, declared runtime source JARs and source-bearing GWT adapter artifacts. No downstream ELK patches.",
